  m_Name: NoteData_Pharaoh
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  statueName: The Pharaoh
  pages:
  - 'This is a pharaoh, the king of Egypt!

    A long, long time ago his nose

    was
    broken off by time and sand.


    But his proud face still tells us:

    "I
    was powerful. I built great things."'
  - "Pharaohs wore a special striped cloth\non their heads called a Nemes.\nOnly
    the king was allowed to wear it!\n\nThis pharaoh watched over his people\nfor
    thousands of years. \U0001F451"
